(5779032, 841141, 66038, '<td valign="top">First, this photo is really good. Her expression seems genuine. There is futility in her eyes. The heavy black gun is a great counterpoint to her pale look. Oddly though, that seemed to take away from the photo. I sensed a gentle anguish, a feminine bleakness so to speak, and the gun adds a jarring masculinity that feels out of place.<br/> Nice job though.</td>', 'First, this photo is really good. Her expression seems genuine. There is futility in her eyes. The heavy black gun is a great counterpoint to her pale look. Oddly though, that seemed to take away from the photo. I sensed a gentle anguish, a feminine bleakness so to speak, and the gun adds a jarring masculinity that feels out of place. Nice job though.', '2009-12-23 08:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
