(5781153, 841267, 105441, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Before I read the caption, I assumed that this bouquet was being given as a symbol of one person''s hate toward another.  But then your caption added a different twist.  The lighting is very effective, and the focus is very good.</td>', 'Great image.  Before I read the caption, I assumed that this bouquet was being given as a symbol of one person''s hate toward another.  But then your caption added a different twist.  The lighting is very effective, and the focus is very good.', '2009-12-25 18:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
