(5781159, 841129, 105441, '<td valign="top">Fabulous entry!  Since I find all cats to be worthy of at least a little hate, this is an excellent choice.  But the cat not only has an evil look in its eye, but the mouth seems to be frowning as well.  The framing and lighting are really great.</td>', 'Fabulous entry!  Since I find all cats to be worthy of at least a little hate, this is an excellent choice.  But the cat not only has an evil look in its eye, but the mouth seems to be frowning as well.  The framing and lighting are really great.', '2009-12-25 18:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5781161, 840996, 105441, '<td valign="top">Pretty intense, both in subject and in processing.  I think you were very successful in achieving the look you were after, and the execution is excellent.</td>', 'Pretty intense, both in subject and in processing.  I think you were very successful in achieving the look you were after, and the execution is excellent.', '2009-12-25 18:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
