(5781163, 841146, 105441, '<td valign="top">This image really fits the theme.  I imagine the subject hating his life, hating his addiction, or hating what he has done.  And the image quality if very good, with nice lighting and separation from the intriguing background.</td>', 'This image really fits the theme.  I imagine the subject hating his life, hating his addiction, or hating what he has done.  And the image quality if very good, with nice lighting and separation from the intriguing background.', '2009-12-25 18:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
