(5781297, 841030, 60173, '<td valign="top">Man, those kids can emote!<br/> <br/>I''m not a fan of the sheet backdrop, and the lighting looks a little flat. I''d recommend pulling them a few feet away from the backdrop to reduce the shadows and using a more open aperture to blur out the details of the backdrop.</td>', 'Man, those kids can emote! I''m not a fan of the sheet backdrop, and the lighting looks a little flat. I''d recommend pulling them a few feet away from the backdrop to reduce the shadows and using a more open aperture to blur out the details of the backdrop.', '2009-12-25 23:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
