(5781753, 841146, 35444, '<td valign="top">This seems more "reflective" than "hate"; but it is a very good photo.</td>', 'This seems more "reflective" than "hate"; but it is a very good photo.', '2009-12-26 16:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5781827, 840745, 42100, '<td valign="top">LOL...hilarious!  Nice b&amp;w conversion.</td>', 'LOL...hilarious!  Nice b&w conversion.', '2009-12-26 17:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5781976, 840859, 60173, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand all the orange. Was she attacked by makeup? A kid I used to babysit did that to any babysitter that wasn''t me. I took it as a compliment, heh.</td>', 'I don''t understand all the orange. Was she attacked by makeup? A kid I used to babysit did that to any babysitter that wasn''t me. I took it as a compliment, heh.', '2009-12-26 22:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782145, 840939, 108331, '<td valign="top">Nice pic and i like the colours.</td>', 'Nice pic and i like the colours.', '2009-12-27 00:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782146, 841030, 108331, '<td valign="top">This is what I call "Fitting the challenge"</td>', 'This is what I call "Fitting the challenge"', '2009-12-27 00:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782327, 841246, 110909, '<td valign="top">really interesting concept!</td>', 'really interesting concept!', '2009-12-27 06:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782368, 841234, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice shot it really conveys that all to said fact about many of todays marriages. I feel that the shot is slightly under exposed as the blade looks more grey then metallic. Also be carful of finger prints when you are taking macro shots.</td>', 'nice shot it really conveys that all to said fact about many of todays marriages. I feel that the shot is slightly under exposed as the blade looks more grey then metallic. Also be carful of finger prints when you are taking macro shots.', '2009-12-27 09:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782373, 840838, 104841, '<td valign="top">really interesting angle with an interesting use of dof, I would have liked to have seen it slightly bigger to cover more of the snail but i guess you needed the fast shutter speed maybe a ring flash would have helped.</td>', 'really interesting angle with an interesting use of dof, I would have liked to have seen it slightly bigger to cover more of the snail but i guess you needed the fast shutter speed maybe a ring flash would have helped.', '2009-12-27 09:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782380, 840745, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice capture and very topical, though I think the cougar should have been a tiger!</td>', 'nice capture and very topical, though I think the cougar should have been a tiger!', '2009-12-27 09:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782387, 840859, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose and the thought behind the shot. I am not so keen on the post production work, for me I feel like you have over done it and you are lacking detail in the hair. This could have happened from you over smoothing or using negative clarity if this was a raw capture.</td>', 'I really like the pose and the thought behind the shot. I am not so keen on the post production work, for me I feel like you have over done it and you are lacking detail in the hair. This could have happened from you over smoothing or using negative clarity if this was a raw capture.', '2009-12-27 09:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782403, 841239, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice studio shot, i dont know about the hand position though. I may have tried to not block so much of her face. Maybe even use the hand to frame the face with her index finger blocking the part in her hair</td>', 'nice studio shot, i dont know about the hand position though. I may have tried to not block so much of her face. Maybe even use the hand to frame the face with her index finger blocking the part in her hair', '2009-12-27 10:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782861, 840562, 99708, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  Not sure how everyone else will feel about it, but for me it represents a strong displeasure. Nice DOF.  There is a dot of light above the pinky that is a little distracting, could be a button from the shirt.</td>', 'I like this picture.  Not sure how everyone else will feel about it, but for me it represents a strong displeasure. Nice DOF.  There is a dot of light above the pinky that is a little distracting, could be a button from the shirt.', '2009-12-27 19:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782870, 840770, 99708, '<td valign="top">Nice use of props.  Unfortunately, for me the coloring and lighting left the picture feeling a little flat.</td>', 'Nice use of props.  Unfortunately, for me the coloring and lighting left the picture feeling a little flat.', '2009-12-27 19:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782877, 841256, 99708, '<td valign="top">Ha ha.  My daughter feels the same way.  Her expression is perfect for the challenge, looks natural not posed.  If there was one thing I would improve in this shot it would be the background, maybe something more uniform or cohesive.</td>', 'Ha ha.  My daughter feels the same way.  Her expression is perfect for the challenge, looks natural not posed.  If there was one thing I would improve in this shot it would be the background, maybe something more uniform or cohesive.', '2009-12-27 19:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782881, 840656, 99708, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going with this shot, but for me the effect is not appealing and does not convey hate.</td>', 'I see where you were going with this shot, but for me the effect is not appealing and does not convey hate.', '2009-12-27 19:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782883, 840836, 99708, '<td valign="top">Nice depth.  Even without the title, I believe a view would get the story.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice depth.  Even without the title, I believe a view would get the story.  Good job.', '2009-12-27 19:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782886, 841146, 99708, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the use of b&amp;w, and te subject.  I''m trying to find something I could suggest improvement on but I can''t.  :)</td>', 'I like the composition, the use of b&w, and te subject.  I''m trying to find something I could suggest improvement on but I can''t.  :)', '2009-12-27 19:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782888, 841208, 99708, '<td valign="top">You successfuly captured the look of jealousy (which goes hand in hand with hate).  I want to say that I love this shot, but I find the fact that his nose if oof a bit distracting.  Otherwise, good job.</td>', 'You successfuly captured the look of jealousy (which goes hand in hand with hate).  I want to say that I love this shot, but I find the fact that his nose if oof a bit distracting.  Otherwise, good job.', '2009-12-27 19:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782889, 841226, 99708, '<td valign="top">IMO this DNMC.  Sorry.</td>', 'IMO this DNMC.  Sorry.', '2009-12-27 19:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782891, 840815, 99708, '<td valign="top">What a cutie pie.  He may like the snow more if he had snow booties and a coat.  Other than looking a little cold, I''m not seeing much hate in his face.</td>', 'What a cutie pie.  He may like the snow more if he had snow booties and a coat.  Other than looking a little cold, I''m not seeing much hate in his face.', '2009-12-27 19:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782892, 841096, 99708, '<td valign="top">That reminds me, I need to make one of my ex.  Ha ha.  Cute picture, the title is a bit rough though.</td>', 'That reminds me, I need to make one of my ex.  Ha ha.  Cute picture, the title is a bit rough though.', '2009-12-27 19:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782896, 840859, 99708, '<td valign="top">Worried?  Yes.  Scared?  Most likely.  Hate?  I don''t see it.  <br/>All the technical is there, but I am finding that the make up is hurting the picture more than it is conveying the story.</td>', 'Worried?  Yes.  Scared?  Most likely.  Hate?  I don''t see it.  All the technical is there, but I am finding that the make up is hurting the picture more than it is conveying the story.', '2009-12-27 19:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782897, 841281, 99708, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2009-12-27 19:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5782900, 840996, 99708, '<td valign="top">He looks like he''s hurting.</td>', 'He looks like he''s hurting.', '2009-12-27 19:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5783531, 841146, 112977, '<td valign="top">painful moment! greate shot</td>', 'painful moment! greate shot', '2009-12-28 03:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5783839, 841267, 101536, '<td valign="top">Snap - so do I!</td>', 'Snap - so do I!', '2009-12-28 11:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784172, 840745, 99708, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Let me first say that this is not my favorite pic in the bunch, but it is a good one.  Good job in capturing the detailing on the club (is that the size she used when she went after Tiger?).  7</td>', 'Funny.  Let me first say that this is not my favorite pic in the bunch, but it is a good one.  Good job in capturing the detailing on the club (is that the size she used when she went after Tiger?).  7', '2009-12-28 16:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784174, 840732, 99708, '<td valign="top">This shot would work wonderfuly for a book cover!  Creative and original.</td>', 'This shot would work wonderfuly for a book cover!  Creative and original.', '2009-12-28 16:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784183, 841266, 99708, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  I was getting tired of seeing all the b&amp;w in the challenge, but this is a pic I think would of benefited if it were in b&amp;w.  I like the expression on your model''s face.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  I was getting tired of seeing all the b&w in the challenge, but this is a pic I think would of benefited if it were in b&w.  I like the expression on your model''s face.', '2009-12-28 16:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784187, 841129, 99708, '<td valign="top">The kitty is cute and he looks angry. My cat usually runs when I pull out the camera, but if he stayed, he''d give me looks like this.  Overall I like the picture.</td>', 'The kitty is cute and he looks angry. My cat usually runs when I pull out the camera, but if he stayed, he''d give me looks like this.  Overall I like the picture.', '2009-12-28 16:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784196, 841267, 99708, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  You managed to make something that most people would consider ugly into something beautiful.  Great Job!  <br/>Unfortunatley, I am going to knock it down a point because I don''t feel that it meets the challenge. (9)  If it helps, I''m making this one of my favorites.</td>', 'I love this picture.  You managed to make something that most people would consider ugly into something beautiful.  Great Job!  Unfortunatley, I am going to knock it down a point because I don''t feel that it meets the challenge. (9)  If it helps, I''m making this one of my favorites.', '2009-12-28 16:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784202, 841234, 99708, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, and overall it is a nice photo.  If you do another one like this in the future, I''d recommend playing with the lighting - it seems a little dull.</td>', 'I like the concept, and overall it is a nice photo.  If you do another one like this in the future, I''d recommend playing with the lighting - it seems a little dull.', '2009-12-28 16:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784206, 841246, 99708, '<td valign="top">It looks as if his fist is coming out of his mouth.  Was this intentional?</td>', 'It looks as if his fist is coming out of his mouth.  Was this intentional?', '2009-12-28 16:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784353, 841211, 106349, '<td valign="top">Love the colors...</td>', 'Love the colors...', '2009-12-28 18:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784558, 840996, 107938, '<td valign="top">A great image!  Very well executed and the color is fantastic.</td>', 'A great image!  Very well executed and the color is fantastic.', '2009-12-28 21:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784562, 841208, 107938, '<td valign="top">Haunting.  Revealing title.  I am a bit distracted by how bright the face is and how the forehead seems a bit out of focus in comparison.</td>', 'Haunting.  Revealing title.  I am a bit distracted by how bright the face is and how the forehead seems a bit out of focus in comparison.', '2009-12-28 21:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784565, 841239, 107938, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea.  I wish the background wasn''t so white that her dress blended in to it so much.</td>', 'Very interesting idea.  I wish the background wasn''t so white that her dress blended in to it so much.', '2009-12-28 21:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784566, 841097, 107938, '<td valign="top">Simple and evocative.</td>', 'Simple and evocative.', '2009-12-28 21:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784571, 841146, 107938, '<td valign="top">At first glance, the model appeared to be a monk.  Therefore, I was distracted when I saw the digital stopwatch and fleece sweatshirt.  Nevertheless, I love the idea behind this shot.  Well done!</td>', 'At first glance, the model appeared to be a monk.  Therefore, I was distracted when I saw the digital stopwatch and fleece sweatshirt.  Nevertheless, I love the idea behind this shot.  Well done!', '2009-12-28 21:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784575, 840836, 107938, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing idea, but well executed concept.  Great depth of field.</td>', 'Very disturbing idea, but well executed concept.  Great depth of field.', '2009-12-28 21:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784576, 841267, 107938, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  I love how clear the details are.</td>', 'Clever idea.  I love how clear the details are.', '2009-12-28 21:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784580, 841030, 107938, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but it seems a little too staged for my taste.</td>', 'A good idea, but it seems a little too staged for my taste.', '2009-12-28 21:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784582, 841211, 107938, '<td valign="top">Yeah, me too!  Nice idea for the challenge.</td>', 'Yeah, me too!  Nice idea for the challenge.', '2009-12-28 21:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784587, 840745, 107938, '<td valign="top">It is a little difficult to make out that she is aiming for a car because the depth of field is so shallow.  The tree''s shadow in the windshield keeps distracting me as does the lower right hand side headlight.  However, I like the concept a lot.</td>', 'It is a little difficult to make out that she is aiming for a car because the depth of field is so shallow.  The tree''s shadow in the windshield keeps distracting me as does the lower right hand side headlight.  However, I like the concept a lot.', '2009-12-28 21:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784689, 840859, 86447, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the orange... but the photography is excellent!</td>', 'I don''t understand the orange... but the photography is excellent!', '2009-12-28 22:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784691, 841234, 86447, '<td valign="top">Looks like Will''s star in "When there''s nothing left to say". <br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'Looks like Will''s star in "When there''s nothing left to say".  Well done!', '2009-12-28 22:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784769, 841239, 18197, '<td valign="top">Unusual out-of-the-box image. I like the creativity.</td>', 'Unusual out-of-the-box image. I like the creativity.', '2009-12-28 23:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784770, 840562, 18197, '<td valign="top">This may not fare well in the voting, but I like the emotion you''re conveying here.  Well composed. Well captured. Well presented.</td>', 'This may not fare well in the voting, but I like the emotion you''re conveying here.  Well composed. Well captured. Well presented.', '2009-12-28 23:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784771, 840477, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract arcs juxtaposed against the face. Not sure how well it fits the challenge but among my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'I like the abstract arcs juxtaposed against the face. Not sure how well it fits the challenge but among my favorites this challenge.', '2009-12-28 23:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784772, 841146, 18197, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. Among my favorite images this challenge ... may not fit the challenge as well as some others.</td>', 'Stunning image. Among my favorite images this challenge ... may not fit the challenge as well as some others.', '2009-12-28 23:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784773, 841277, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Don''t know if hate applies in nature. But I know I like this image very much!</td>', 'Wonderful image. Don''t know if hate applies in nature. But I know I like this image very much!', '2009-12-28 23:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784777, 840836, 18197, '<td valign="top">I grew up with guns, was taught never to point a gun at anything you didn''t want to kill. Neat image that juxtaposes love (flower) and hate (guns &amp; ammo.) Nice title.</td>', 'I grew up with guns, was taught never to point a gun at anything you didn''t want to kill. Neat image that juxtaposes love (flower) and hate (guns & ammo.) Nice title.', '2009-12-28 23:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784779, 841267, 18197, '<td valign="top">I understand the title but don''t resonate with it. I "get" the image but don''t understand the connection wit the "hate" theme. Still ... it''s a wonderful image ... among my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'I understand the title but don''t resonate with it. I "get" the image but don''t understand the connection wit the "hate" theme. Still ... it''s a wonderful image ... among my favorites this challenge.', '2009-12-28 23:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784781, 840996, 18197, '<td valign="top">Stupid, over processed image ... but still I''m drawn to it. The original image is good. The processing is good, if not to my liking. I''m not sure why I like it, but bless me, I do. Good work!</td>', 'Stupid, over processed image ... but still I''m drawn to it. The original image is good. The processing is good, if not to my liking. I''m not sure why I like it, but bless me, I do. Good work!', '2009-12-28 23:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784784, 840770, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliant image. One of the few 10''s I''ve given. Stark! Simple! Elegant! A bit of further processing would give it more depth. Maybe some dodge &amp; burn of the shadows ... maybe a multiply over layer ... not sure. But way good enough as is.</td>', 'Brilliant image. One of the few 10''s I''ve given. Stark! Simple! Elegant! A bit of further processing would give it more depth. Maybe some dodge & burn of the shadows ... maybe a multiply over layer ... not sure. But way good enough as is.', '2009-12-28 23:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784785, 840859, 18197, '<td valign="top">How can an image depicting hate make me smile? Don''t know but this onme does! Well done.</td>', 'How can an image depicting hate make me smile? Don''t know but this onme does! Well done.', '2009-12-28 23:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784786, 841249, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well captured, and presented. Don''t like it, but that''s the intent, right? Gave you a good score.</td>', 'Well captured, and presented. Don''t like it, but that''s the intent, right? Gave you a good score.', '2009-12-29 00:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
