(5784807, 841231, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am so conflicted over this I probably can''t rate it objectively.<br/> <br/>I hate being a target.<br/> <br/>I hate all religions that promote their own existence at the expense of violence to others.<br/> <br/>I think I could like your subject, if only I could know him and he know me.<br/> <br/>I hate that it is unlikely.<br/> <br/>Boy did you rile me up with this ... Nice Work!!!</td>', 'I am so conflicted over this I probably can''t rate it objectively. I hate being a target. I hate all religions that promote their own existence at the expense of violence to others. I think I could like your subject, if only I could know him and he know me. I hate that it is unlikely. Boy did you rile me up with this ... Nice Work!!!', '2009-12-29 00:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
