(5784816, 841096, 18197, '<td valign="top">I "dislike" trolls, too ... but this isn''t really a hateful image! Well enough composed and presented. Obvious mastery of the camera. It''s a subject issue for me.</td>', 'I "dislike" trolls, too ... but this isn''t really a hateful image! Well enough composed and presented. Obvious mastery of the camera. It''s a subject issue for me.', '2009-12-29 00:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5784819, 841234, 18197, '<td valign="top">I get very well what you''re trying to convey here and I believe it fits the challenge very well. Too bad it''s such a flat image, and too bad about the composition. Maybe dropping a copy of the image in Multiply mode over the original would give it more depth. Maybe moving the subject just a little to the right would add a bit to the composition.<br/> <br/>But then, it''s only an opinion.</td>', 'I get very well what you''re trying to convey here and I believe it fits the challenge very well. Too bad it''s such a flat image, and too bad about the composition. Maybe dropping a copy of the image in Multiply mode over the original would give it more depth. Maybe moving the subject just a little to the right would add a bit to the composition. But then, it''s only an opinion.', '2009-12-29 00:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
