(5788990, 841097, 60173, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gwsallen:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aliqui:</b></div><hr/><i> Leaving and going to Yale? I''m kidding of course. I''m assuming you intend that to be a house key? I wonder if you could have set up the same objects differently somehow to better portray that it was a house key. On a table with more of a wood finish perhaps? Something like that... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanks for suggestion.<br/>what about on a plate and with new title - "Find your own dinner from now on!" LoL :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>lol, That might work.</td>', 'Originally posted by gwsallen: Originally posted by aliqui: Leaving and going to Yale? I''m kidding of course. I''m assuming you intend that to be a house key? I wonder if you could have set up the same objects differently somehow to better portray that it was a house key. On a table with more of a wood finish perhaps? Something like that...   thanks for suggestion.what about on a plate and with new title - "Find your own dinner from now on!" LoL :D   lol, That might work.', '2009-12-31 23:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
